s0.en:
{n}×{n_2} KenKen. Each row and column has 1..{n_3} once. Letters mark cages; each cage shows the result of an operation on its numbers (e.g. '7+' sum 7, '6×' product 6, '2−' difference 2, '2÷' quotient 2). Fill the grid and list all {v3} numbers row by row.
